<Layout title="Volunteer research support — Mario Marcolongo"><SiteNav/><main id="main-content" class="presence-shell case-shell"><p class="eyebrow">University of Padua project · Volunteer collaboration · 2022–2025</p><h1>Helping people participate in research.</h1><p class="lede">I supported remote focus groups with autistic participants, combining facilitation, recruitment, bibliographic research and practical preparation.</p><p>The collaboration was supervised by Marta Panzeri in the Department of Developmental Psychology and Socialisation at the University of Padua.</p>
<section><h2>My contribution</h2><ul><li>Led or co-facilitated approximately 4–5 remote sessions, typically lasting 1–2 hours.</li><li>Helped develop accessible participation procedures: pseudonymous names, explicit consent, optional captions and written-chat participation, structured prompts and timed turns.</li><li>Supported participant recruitment, literature research and technical preparation.</li><li>Coordinated with the supervisor, researchers and another facilitator, including recording boundaries and facilitation handoffs.</li></ul></section>
<section><h2>What the work involved</h2><p>The focus groups concerned sexuality and relationships. I prepared facilitation guides and helped create a nonjudgmental discussion: using neutral prompts, managing turns and making room for both spoken and written responses. Consent, recording boundaries and coordination with a second facilitator were part of the procedure. This was research facilitation, with responsibilities distinct from platform moderation or clinical care. Participant identities and confidential session content are not included here.</p></section>
<section><h2>Project record and attribution</h2><p>The university thesis documents the project and methodology. The project's facilitation guides identify me as a facilitator and document the participation procedures described above. My approximate session count remains self-reported; the thesis does not name the facilitators. Confidential research materials are not published here.</p><div class="source-links"><a href="https://thesis.unipd.it/handle/20.500.12608/51396">University thesis record</a><a href="https://dpss.unipd.it/en/node/239">Supervisor profile</a></div></section><p><a href="/cv">Research &amp; technical operations résumé ↗</a></p></main><SiteFooter/></Layout>
